{"id":"endlich","lemma":"endlich","pos":"adv","rank":323,"glosses":["eventually, at last, finally"],"ipa":"/ˈɛntlɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/14/De-endlich.ogg/De-endlich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Endlich sind wir allein.","en":"We're finally alone.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700303","words":[null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"alone"}]},{"text":"Warum wirst du nicht endlich erwachsen?","en":"Why don't you grow up?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756841","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"to grow up, to grow"}]},{"text":"Wir haben es endlich getan.","en":"We finally did it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392725","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to do","l":"tun"}]},{"text":"Endlich funktioniert es wieder.","en":"It's finally working again.","words":[null,{"g":"to work, function","l":"funktionieren"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"again"}]},{"text":"Ich habe endlich ein Zuhause gefunden.","en":"I finally found a home.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757142","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"one’s living premises"},{"g":"found, located"}]}]}